\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Thou art the Way: to Thee alone\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 From sin and death we flee;
\par And he who would the Father seek
\par Must seek Him, Lord, by Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Thou art the Truth: Thy word alone
\par \pard     True wisdom can impart;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1 Thou only canst inform the mind;\cf0 
\par  And purify the heart.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Thou art the Life: the rending tomb
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Proclaims Thy conquering arm;
\par  And those who put their trust in Thee
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   Nor death nor hell shall harm.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Thou art the Way, the Truth, the Life:
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  Grant us that Way to know,
\par  That Truth to keep, that Life to win,
\par \pard     Whose joys eternal flow. Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

